/github.com/NutritionalLungImmunity/PAI<!--end-target-repository-->\n**Branch with paper.md** (empty if default branch): <!--branch--><!--end-branch-->\n**Version:** <!--version-->v1.0.0<!--end-version-->\n**Editor:** <!--editor-->@majensen<!--end-editor-->\n**Reviewers:** <!--reviewers-list-->@DavidNickle, @majensen<!--end-reviewers-list-->\n**Archive:** <!--archive-->10.5281/zenodo.20171460<!--end-archive-->\n\n## Status\n\n[![status](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/865bd5679780846ee3f488e82a241615/status.svg)](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/865bd5679780846ee3f488e82a241615)\n\nStatus badge code:\n\n```\nHTML: <a href=\"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/865bd5679780846ee3f488e82a241615\"><img src=\"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/865bd5679780846ee3f488e82a241615/status.svg\"></a>\nMarkdown: [![status](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/865bd5679780846ee3f488e82a241615/status.svg)](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/865bd5679780846ee3f488e82a241615)\n```\n**Reviewers and authors**:\n\nPlease avoid lengthy details of difficulties in the review thread. Instead, please create a new issue in the <a href=\"https://github.com/NutritionalLungImmunity/PAI\" target=\"_blank\">target repository</a> and link to those issues (especially acceptance-blockers) by leaving comments in the review thread below. (For completists: if the target issue tracker is also on GitHub, linking the review thread in the issue or vice versa will create corresponding breadcrumb trails in the link target.)\n\n## Reviewer instructions & questions\n\n@DavidNickle & @majensen, your review will be checklist based. Each of you will have a separate checklist that you should update when carrying out your review.\nFirst of all you need to run this command in a separate comment to create the checklist:\n\n```\n@editorialbot generate my checklist\n```\n\nThe reviewer guidelines are available here: https://joss.readthedocs.io/en/latest/reviewer_guidelines.html. Any questions/concerns please let @majensen know.\n\n✨ **Please start on your review when you are able; the expectation is that it will take 2-4 weeks to complete.** ✨ \n\n\n## Checklists\n\n<!--checklist-comments-->\n<!--checklist-for-majensen-->\n📝 [Checklist for @majensen](https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4111257614)\n<!--end-checklist-for-majensen-->\n<!--end-checklist-comments-->\n","closed_by":{"login":"Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","id":8392709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzOTI3MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8392709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","html_url":"https://github.com/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}